    "authorAssociation": "NONE",
    "body": "I saw someone aligning Verilog code in the way show below, and I tried to achieve this behavior with mini.align without sucess. Is it possible?\r\nThe pattern aligns something like this:\r\n``` // Variables\r\n  wire [NB_COUNTER-1 : 0] limitMux;\r\n  reg  counter;\r\n  reg  valid;\r\n```\r\ninto this:\r\n```  // Variables\r\n  wire [NB_COUNTER-1 : 0] limitMux;\r\n  reg                      counter;\r\n  reg                        valid;\r\n```\r\nSo it's somehow using full justification. It's not my style, I just saw someone that does it by hand.",
    "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">I saw someone aligning Verilog code in the way show below, and I tried to achieve this behavior with mini.align without sucess. Is it possible?<br>\nThe pattern aligns something like this:</p>\n<div class=\"snippet-clipboard-content notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"  wire [NB_COUNTER-1 : 0] limitMux;\n  reg  counter;\n  reg  valid;\"><pre lang=\"//\" class=\"notranslate\"><code class=\"notranslate\">  wire [NB_COUNTER-1 : 0] limitMux;\n  reg  counter;\n  reg  valid;\n</code></pre></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">into this:</p>\n<div class=\"snippet-clipboard-content notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"  wire [NB_COUNTER-1 : 0] limitMux;\n  reg                      counter;\n  reg                        valid;\"><pre lang=\"//\" class=\"notranslate\"><code class=\"notranslate\">  wire [NB_COUNTER-1 : 0] limitMux;\n  reg                      counter;\n  reg                        valid;\n</code></pre></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">So it's somehow using full justification. It's not my style, I just saw someone that does it by hand.</p>",
    "bodyText": "I saw someone aligning Verilog code in the way show below, and I tried to achieve this behavior with mini.align without sucess. Is it possible?\nThe pattern aligns something like this:\n  wire [NB_COUNTER-1 : 0] limitMux;\n  reg  counter;\n  reg  valid;\n\ninto this:\n  wire [NB_COUNTER-1 : 0] limitMux;\n  reg                      counter;\n  reg                        valid;\n\nSo it's somehow using full justification. It's not my style, I just saw someone that does it by hand.",
