            "authorAssociation": "MEMBER",
            "body": "If the goal is full justification (like in \"make each line span same width with words spread equally inside it\"), then I don't think it is possible with 'mini.align'. It is designed to align \"per column\" with column defined as \"something between separators\".",
            "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">If the goal is full justification (like in \"make each line span same width with words spread equally inside it\"), then I don't think it is possible with 'mini.align'. It is designed to align \"per column\" with column defined as \"something between separators\".</p>",
            "bodyText": "If the goal is full justification (like in \"make each line span same width with words spread equally inside it\"), then I don't think it is possible with 'mini.align'. It is designed to align \"per column\" with column defined as \"something between separators\".",
